{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9bcbe30df8197144d3975a879a0e44d72a220cb200a28a31cb201bff84142453", "ja": "（ユニットの公演後、和に関する仕事が増えた。\n今日は紬の取材で、着物について話してもらった）", "zh": "（组合公演结束后，和风相关的工作增加了。\n今天是为紬安排的采访，请她聊了聊和服）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dc5da5e450132ec9c945e5c89f3d18cecb7515762af23904e424bceb62443bbd", "ja": "紬、お疲れさま。\n予定より遅くなっちゃったな。", "zh": "紬，辛苦了。比预定时间晚了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "19662bde38a1da55a02321aaa56e9f462a15fe56175d640e6ad154cf3fbb14ba", "ja": "お気になさらず。私たちのユニットを、大勢の方に\n知っていただけるのは、よろこばしいことです。", "zh": "请不要在意。能让更多人了解我们的组合，是件令人高兴的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d642e05678a2ee5c362a2dc456a7772d5ebb57aec95bda006ba103c3a16527a9", "ja": "今回のユニット、紬は大活躍だったな。\nおかげでみんなも落ち着いて公演できたと思う。", "zh": "这次的组合，䌷可是大放异彩啊。多亏了你，我觉得大家也都能沉着地完成演出了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "82208662a942e94f1cc6edd9468f6eb4132b98cdac6da06f1207c8f4074fd152", "ja": "……？　私は、特別なことは何も……\n普段どおりだったかと思います。", "zh": "……？我并没有做什么特别的事……\n应该只是和往常一样而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1005_p", "source_sha256": "68ee5851887a05aa180435f7109fe7d01069377e9baa9646622a44d334f7dbcb", "ja": "それが良かったんだよ。紬は3人の中で一番年上だろ？\nお姉さんとして、しっかりユニットを支えてくれた。", "zh": "那样就很好啊。紬是3人中年纪最大的吧？\n作为姐姐，你稳稳地支撑起了整个组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "86f8fc42b0528583a16238bcad81e62897b7e7673ed3dca791294f843caba194", "ja": "そ……そんなふうにほめていただけるほど、\n特別なことではないと思いますが……。", "zh": "虽……虽然我觉得还没到值得您这样夸奖的程度，  \n也不是什么特别了不起的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "598c81ad053218a655de36729df79f4e996fab78180c446a67c411815d4b26f4", "ja": "けど……みなさんのお役に立てたのでしたら、\nうれしく思います。", "zh": "不过……如果能帮上大家的忙，我也会很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c0c0a33bf56e66d9e53af53f237a7debe8fbcd0e63a77d950cd686d76bb75121", "ja": "劇場のみなさんが、いつも私にしてくれること。\nすこしでも、返せたなら……。", "zh": "剧场的大家一直以来为我做的事。\n要是我也能稍微回报一些……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b7672b6f095a677a0447e1c999b6c7fc373ba64f596f69683146db1eebb99e39", "ja": "劇場のみんな？", "zh": "剧场的大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "618d6fd5ed9fa1c4e8395bec163e63c217068cf49f7da1dbc8b258d899f69e7a", "ja": "はい。今でも、舞台に立つ前は、\n緊張してしまうことが多いのですが……。", "zh": "是的。即使到了现在，我在登台前也经常会紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "266ab5a5790ebe88dd8e8be8d8f452639ade9236e4880bfb01cfeb73844a62a5", "ja": "先輩方や、年上のみなさんが、私の様子に\n気付いて、声をかけてくださいます。", "zh": "前辈们和年长的各位注意到了我的样子，都会主动来和我说话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "47fea75878446e5a7efcadbd3e5d60fd0b2f6761d7b0cbd0ae8e8aa686885205", "ja": "今日まで、たくさんの方に、励まされてきました。\n……だから今回は、私が支える番だっただけかと。", "zh": "直到今天，我一直都受到许多人的鼓励。\n……所以这次，只是轮到我来支持别人而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e0e7b83e6f1c55beef36541c8968d967e0d213bcfdb57376ec16086e8e26e7fa", "ja": "そうか。……ありがとうな、紬。", "zh": "这样啊。……谢谢你，紬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "15de6a143e9b99cf1cc6acbe8dd314ad3205cff83bbea2a59ce3731a4e58af4c", "ja": "で、ですから、何故あなたがお礼を……もうっ。\nそんなん言われたら、うち……。", "zh": "所、所以说，你为什么要道谢……真是的。你这么一说，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "500ba6616c4b50aee4b9ec0bf57c197ab020d274229675d026c208a68a35803d", "ja": "紬？", "zh": "紬？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "39e5ebc790fe1b87d7a45e66e44c84571ca3bfc1e0293fae513beaca922efb09", "ja": "い、いえ、なんでもありません。\nええと、その……うぅ……。", "zh": "没、没什么。\n那个，就是……呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d06bf6c47c9a71ff30db76ef8aa9b3b6a01b25020700544bdb18c87c0ceea4e8", "ja": "あ、あなたは、そうして私のことを\nほめてくれますが……それは、口だけなのですか？", "zh": "啊、您总是这样夸奖我……难道只是嘴上说说而已吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c92505ce2b4676de693e2eaf8fd329f500431f4ccc727a18516a6a694a041dc5", "ja": "ん？　……もしかして、\n紬も何かごほうびが欲しいのか？", "zh": "嗯？……难道说，\n紬也想要什么奖励吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "947ac57480decd00379dc9a17e7023d8c3f1d051afde8e5026443590a6ca65a3", "ja": "そ、そういうわけではありませんが！\nその、ねだっているわけではないのですが……。", "zh": "不、不是那样的！\n那个，我也不是在向您讨要什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7a4a53b40f63c310f7978fc98861c1b13313725b13407558f6675ee8e0928431", "ja": "すぐ近くに、評判の甘味処があるのです。\n以前から、行ってみたいと思っていて……。", "zh": "就在附近有一家口碑很好的甜品店。\n我以前就一直想去看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3759e0922166374277b3070e4485ddb89b22ae36c3fa7d20b7f425d941aee810", "ja": "なんだ、それならお安い御用だ。\nせっかくだ、寄っていこう！", "zh": "什么嘛，那就小事一桩了。难得有机会，一起去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e8b90d6f174b5d2030d7eb25ff703ac9fd71a648d901e725c3472dd8b2808568", "ja": "そうですか。……ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "这样啊。……谢谢您，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0143_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a36951bd0e33763b8a94ca1da42816ce9a164667a361c1fd91b38fcaf4336118", "ja": "あの、それと……珍しいあんみつが、2種類あって。\nふ、ふたつ頼んでも良いですか……？", "zh": "那个，还有……有2种少见的豆沙水果凉粉。\n可、可以点两份吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
